OL,3,ASix killed in Krakow 'far-right'
OL,4,Ashooting, as three more bodies found in
OL,5,Aattacker's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe attacker, who was equipped with
OL,8,Fmilitary-style weapons and attire, was
OL,9,Finjured in a gunfight with police, one
OL,10,Fof whom was critically injured in the
OL,11,Fprocess.
OL,13,FThe 25-year-old Polish man - described
OL,14,Fby one minister as "ultra-nationalist"
OL,15,F- has been taken to hospital for
OL,16,Fsurgery.
